      "weather": "Overcast",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAW GALAXY (2) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (24.77) at Goulburn. Solid record here at the distance winning 12 races. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Overdue and expected to feature again. JOANNE (5) ran good time (29.84) winning a Grade 5 at this track when jumping from this same box. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. BACK TOMORROW (1) is a well performed dog and winner of 21 races who is worth forgiving after finishing out of the placings at Taree Super Track (30.34). Solid record here at the distance winning eight races. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Better than last start and can bounce back. ETHANOL SECRET (3) comes here following a handy fourth in 30.32 latest. Don't underestimate on that time.",
